WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,150 --> 00:00:05,390
I can't even use up all my strength.

2
00:00:08,330 --> 00:00:10,130
The tough guy who came back from that trip to the mall

3
00:00:10,410 --> 00:00:11,530
Just use it to try it out

4
00:00:11,770 --> 00:00:23,380
A force that can break a fork

5
00:00:31,470 --> 00:00:32,430
There was a power outage early

6
00:00:32,950 --> 00:00:34,270
I lasted for half a year in my previous life

7
00:00:34,590 --> 00:00:43,670
This time, the wave of escapes has finally come in half a month.

8
00:00:44,190 --> 00:00:45,870
This road must be blocked with dead people
